{"id":12444,"date":"2025-03-24T12:23:35","date_gmt":"2025-03-24T12:23:35","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/?p=12444"},"modified":"2025-03-24T12:25:01","modified_gmt":"2025-03-24T12:25:01","slug":"vyuziti-ramanovy-mikroskopie-k-analyze-napeti-strain-polovodicu","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/vyuziti-ramanovy-mikroskopie-k-analyze-napeti-strain-polovodicu\/","title":{"rendered":"Vyu\u017eit\u00ed Ramanovy mikroskopie k anal\u00fdze nap\u011bt\u00ed (strain) polovodi\u010d\u016f"},"content":{"rendered":"<p><a href=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/produkt\/dxr3xi-mikroskop\/\"><strong>Ramanova spektroskopie<\/strong><\/a> je vysoce citliv\u00e1 na jemn\u00e9 zm\u011bny struktury krystalov\u00e9 m\u0159\u00ed\u017eky polovodi\u010dov\u00fdch materi\u00e1l\u016f. Pokud je polovodi\u010d p\u0159i v\u00fdrob\u011b nam\u00e1h\u00e1n (tlakem, tahem \u010di n\u011bjak\u00fdm sofistikovan\u011bj\u0161\u00edm zp\u016fsobem), jeho molekul\u00e1rn\u00ed vazby se m\u00edrn\u011b posouvaj\u00ed, a m\u011bn\u00ed se tak vibra\u010dn\u00ed frekvence m\u0159\u00ed\u017eky (\u201elattice\u201c: m\u0159\u00ed\u017ekov\u00e9 vibrace). M\u011b\u0159en\u00edm t\u011bchto jemn\u00fdch posun\u016f v Ramanov\u00fdch spektrech lze odvodit intenzitu a typ nap\u011bt\u00ed p\u0159\u00edtomn\u00e9ho v polovodi\u010dov\u00e9m materi\u00e1lu. Takov\u00e9 informace jsou z\u00e1sadn\u00ed v\u00a0technologii v\u00fdroby polovodi\u010d\u016f, proto\u017ee i mal\u00e9 mno\u017estv\u00ed nap\u011bt\u00ed (strain) m\u016f\u017ee v\u00fdrazn\u011b ovliv\u0148ovat (pozitivn\u011b i negativn\u011b) vlastnosti materi\u00e1lu a n\u00e1sledn\u011b kvalitu vyr\u00e1b\u011bn\u00e9ho za\u0159\u00edzen\u00ed.<\/p>\n<p>V\u00fdroba <strong>integrovan\u00fdch obvod\u016f<\/strong> zahrnuje mnoho krok\u016f v\u010detn\u011b r\u016fzn\u00fdch typ\u016f o\u0161et\u0159en\u00ed a tak\u00e9 formace vno\u0159en\u00fdch mikrostruktur, co\u017e zahrnuje i depozici materi\u00e1l\u016f s r\u016fznou krystalovou m\u0159\u00ed\u017ekou a tepelnou rozta\u017enost\u00ed. Tyto kroky p\u0159i v\u00fdrob\u011b mohou v\u00e9st k v\u00fdvoji nap\u011bt\u00ed vedouc\u00edho a\u017e k deformaci materi\u00e1l\u016f. Nap\u011bt\u00ed v polovodi\u010d\u00edch vede ke zm\u011bn\u00e1m v optick\u00fdch a elektronick\u00fdch vlastnosti, jako jsou zm\u011bny neline\u00e1rn\u00edch optick\u00fdch jev\u016f, band-gap a mobilita nosi\u010d\u016f elektron\u016f. Ovliv\u0148uje tak\u00e9 \u0161\u00ed\u0159en\u00ed dislokac\u00ed, vytv\u00e1\u0159en\u00ed trhlin a dutin. V n\u011bkter\u00fdch p\u0159\u00edpadech je ov\u0161em do polovodi\u010dov\u00fdch materi\u00e1l\u016f zabudov\u00e1no nap\u011bt\u00ed c\u00edlen\u011b, pro vylep\u0161en\u00ed n\u011bkter\u00e9 konkr\u00e9tn\u00ed vlastnosti. V\u00a0obou p\u0159\u00edpadech je nutn\u00e9 m\u00edt k\u00a0dispozici m\u011b\u0159ic\u00ed techniku pro monitoring a optimalizaci t\u011bchto jev\u016f p\u0159i v\u00fdrob\u011b polovodi\u010d\u016f.<\/p>\n<figure id=\"attachment_12445\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-12445\" style=\"width: 500px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-12445\" src=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2025\/03\/0901730c-300x111.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"500\" height=\"185\" srcset=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2025\/03\/0901730c-300x111.png 300w, https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2025\/03\/0901730c-1024x379.png 1024w, https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2025\/03\/0901730c-768x284.png 768w, https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2025\/03\/0901730c.png 1181w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 500px) 100vw, 500px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-12445\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Heteroepitaxn\u00ed vrstven\u00fd polovodi\u010d<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p>Vzorek na obr\u00e1zku je <strong>heteroepitaxn\u00ed vrstven\u00fd polovodi\u010d<\/strong>. Nanomembr\u00e1na z 41 nm siln\u00e9 vrstvy Si-Ge je deponov\u00e1na na k\u0159em\u00edkov\u00fd substr\u00e1t a pot\u00e9 zakryta dal\u0161\u00ed 23 nm silnou vrstvou (Epi vrstva) k\u0159em\u00edku. Nesoulad mezi krystalovou m\u0159\u00ed\u017ekou vrstev Si-Ge a k\u0159em\u00edku (Si) m\u00e1 za n\u00e1sledek nap\u011bt\u00ed (strain). V r\u00e1mci finalizace v\u00fdroby je nakonec spodn\u00ed k\u0159em\u00edkov\u00fd substr\u00e1t (Si Substrate) odstran\u011bn, ale v tomto p\u0159\u00edklad\u011b nen\u00ed Ramanova imagingu je\u0161t\u011b v\u00fdsledn\u00e1 nanomembr\u00e1na ze substr\u00e1tu uvoln\u011bna. To zp\u016fsobuje \u201evr\u00e1sky\u201c pozorovan\u00e9 na vzorku. Tmav\u00fd kruh uprost\u0159ed \u201evr\u00e1sky\u201c je d\u00edra v polovodi\u010dov\u00e9 nanomembr\u00e1n\u011b, kter\u00e1 umo\u017e\u0148uje p\u0159\u00edstup ke k\u0159em\u00edkov\u00e9mu substr\u00e1tu a je sou\u010d\u00e1st\u00ed procesu k\u00a0fin\u00e1ln\u00edmu uvoln\u011bn\u00ed nanomembr\u00e1ny od Si substr\u00e1tu.<\/p>\n<p>M\u011b\u0159en\u00e1 plocha vrstven\u00e9ho polovodi\u010de je 62,5 \u03bcm x 67,9 \u03bcm, mapov\u00e1no pomoc\u00ed Ramanova imaging mikroskopu DXR3xi s\u00a0excita\u010dn\u00edm laserem 455 nm (velikost pixelu pro imaging byla 0,1 mikrometru, pou\u017eit\u00fd objektiv se zv\u011bt\u0161en\u00edm 100x).<\/p>\n<p><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"aligncenter wp-image-12447\" src=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2025\/03\/8ed2d83d-300x130.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"500\" height=\"216\" srcset=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2025\/03\/8ed2d83d-300x130.png 300w, https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2025\/03\/8ed2d83d-768x332.png 768w, https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2025\/03\/8ed2d83d.png 924w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 500px) 100vw, 500px\" \/><\/p>\n<figure id=\"attachment_12449\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-12449\" style=\"width: 500px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-12449\" src=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2025\/03\/3fc36b04-300x130.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"500\" height=\"216\" srcset=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2025\/03\/3fc36b04-300x130.png 300w, https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2025\/03\/3fc36b04-768x332.png 768w, https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2025\/03\/3fc36b04.png 924w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 500px) 100vw, 500px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-12449\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Raman\u016fv imaging: Zm\u011b\u0159eno Ramanov\u00fdm spektrometrem <a href=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/produkt\/dxr3xi-mikroskop\/\"><strong>Nicolet DXR3xi<\/strong><\/a><\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p>Barvy v\u00fdsledn\u00e9ho imagingu vizu\u00e1ln\u011b reprezentuj\u00ed posun v um\u00edst\u011bn\u00ed k\u0159em\u00edkov\u00e9ho p\u00edku. B\u00edl\u00e1 barva odpov\u00edd\u00e1 standardn\u00edmu um\u00edst\u011bn\u00ed p\u00e1su 520,7 cm<sup>-1<\/sup> k\u0159em\u00edkov\u00e9ho substr\u00e1tu (d\u00edra uprost\u0159ed vr\u00e1sky), \u010d\u00edm tmav\u0161\u00ed barvy, t\u00edm v\u00edce se p\u00e1s k\u0159em\u00edku 520,7 cm<sup>-1<\/sup> posouv\u00e1 k ni\u017e\u0161\u00edm vlno\u010dt\u016fm (\u017elut\u00e1 518,8 cm<sup>-1<\/sup> a\u017e \u010dern\u00e1 512,4 cm<sup>-1<\/sup>). \u010c\u00edm v\u011bt\u0161\u00ed posun t\u00e9to k\u0159em\u00edkov\u00e9 vibrace, t\u00edm v\u011bt\u0161\u00ed nap\u011bt\u00ed (strain).<\/p>\n<figure id=\"attachment_12451\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-12451\" style=\"width: 500px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-12451\" src=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2025\/03\/91c15a32-300x183.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"500\" height=\"305\" srcset=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2025\/03\/91c15a32-300x183.png 300w, https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2025\/03\/91c15a32-1024x626.png 1024w, https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2025\/03\/91c15a32-768x469.png 768w, https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2025\/03\/91c15a32.png 1077w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 500px) 100vw, 500px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-12451\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Ramanova spektra r\u016fzn\u00fdch nanovrstev<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p><strong>Dal\u0161\u00ed literatura:<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>Maximilian Ries, Fabian Heisinger: Using Raman spectroscopy to determine the strain in semiconductor samples, Thermo Fisher Scientific Application note<\/p>\n<p><a href=\"https:\/\/assets.thermofisher.com\/TFS-Assets\/CAD\/Application-Notes\/using-raman-spectroscopy-strain-semiconductor-samples-an1023-en.pdf\">https:\/\/assets.thermofisher.com\/TFS-Assets\/CAD\/Application-Notes\/using-raman-spectroscopy-strain-semiconductor-samples-an1023-en.pdf<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Robert Heintz, Alexander Rzhevskii: Evaluating Silicon using Raman Microscopy,<br \/>\nThermo Fisher Scientific Application note<\/p>\n<p><a href=\"https:\/\/assets.thermofisher.com\/TFS-Assets\/CAD\/Application-Notes\/vib-silicon-analysis-with-raman-microscope-app-note-mcs-an1232-en-11-2024-1887815-web.pdf\">https:\/\/assets.thermofisher.com\/TFS-Assets\/CAD\/Application-Notes\/vib-silicon-analysis-with-raman-microscope-app-note-mcs-an1232-en-11-2024-1887815-web.pdf<\/a><\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Ramanova spektroskopie je vysoce citliv\u00e1 na jemn\u00e9 zm\u011bny struktury krystalov\u00e9 m\u0159\u00ed\u017eky polovodi\u010dov\u00fdch materi\u00e1l\u016f. Pokud je polovodi\u010d p\u0159i v\u00fdrob\u011b nam\u00e1h\u00e1n (tlakem, tahem \u010di n\u011bjak\u00fdm sofistikovan\u011bj\u0161\u00edm zp\u016fsobem), jeho molekul\u00e1rn\u00ed vazby se m\u00edrn\u011b posouvaj\u00ed, a m\u011bn\u00ed se tak vibra\u010dn\u00ed frekvence m\u0159\u00ed\u017eky (\u201elattice\u201c: m\u0159\u00ed\u017ekov\u00e9 vibrace). M\u011b\u0159en\u00edm t\u011bchto jemn\u00fdch posun\u016f v Ramanov\u00fdch spektrech lze odvodit intenzitu a typ nap\u011bt\u00ed p\u0159\u00edtomn\u00e9ho [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":2,"featured_media":12449,"comment_status":"closed","ping_s